  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nBooks\nGifts\nBubbles & Blooms In the Garden | 6.30 – 8pm | Thurs 9 July 2026 |\n£35.00\n\n118 available\nBubbles & Blooms In the Garden | 6.30 - 8pm | Thurs 9 July 2026 | quantity\nAdd to Cart\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Trust and SSAFA: The Armed Forces Charity present our celebratory summer Garden Party.\n\nDrinks and canapés served throughout, listen to jazz from the Waterloo Band of The Rifles and enjoy exclusive ‘behind the scenes’ tours of the SOFO archives, the From Battlefields to Blooms flower show and the new exhibition, Lee Miller: Woman at War.\n\n---\n\nAdditional event parking will be available at Blenheim Palace for this event.\n\nSat Nav: OX20 1UL\nWhat3Words: ///village.widely.handover\n\nBlenheim Palace parking is approximately 8 minutes walk from the Museum Gardens.\n\n---\n\nProceeds from the sale of your ticket(s) directly support SSAFA, the armed forces charity, and Soldiers of Oxfordshire Trust.\n\nBubbles and Blooms is kindly sponsored by Unipart.\n\nDate: 09-July-2026\nTime: 18:30\n\nLocation: Oxfordshire Museum Gardens, Park Street, Woodstock, Oxfordshire OX20 1SN\nType: digital\n\nRelated products\nLee Miller: A Woman at War – An evening with Ami Bouhassane | 7pm, Thurs 3 September 2026\n£15.00 Add to cart\nMeet Me at the Soldiers Museum | 2pm – 4pm | Thursday 11 June 2026\n£0.00 Add to cart\nMeet Me at the Soldiers Museum | 2pm – 4pm | Thursday 25 June 2026\n£0.00 Add to cart\nWomen at War with Kate Vigurs | 7pm, 19 August 2026\n£15.00 Add to cart\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
